group features/gui
note The tab buttons at the top of the centre switch between Path, Diff, Graph, Listing and Results (Results shows its hit count); the buttons at the top of the left panel switch between Paths, Symbols and Files. Switching changes only what is shown: the selection, the path being read and the file stay. Other features switch the centre tab on their own (opening a line shows the Listing, a search shows Results).

